      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "48 Devenish Road, Kimmage, Dublin 12\r\nSet in the well established and much loved residential area of Kimmage, Devenish Road is part of a mature Dublin neighbourhood with a long-standing sense of community and strong connections to the city. Kimmage has evolved from its earlier suburban development into one of Dublin 12’s popular residential districts, valued for its established streetscapes, local amenities and convenient access to Dublin city centre.\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents are delighted to present 48 Devenish Road to the market, a beautifully presented three-bedroom family home that is ready to simply move into and enjoy.\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the property provides a warm and welcoming impression, with a lovely finish throughout and a clear emphasis on comfort, style and practicality. The extended accommodation offers well proportioned living space with 3 reception rooms, a modern kitchen together with three bedrooms and a family bathroom making it an ideal home for first-time buyers, young families or those looking to move into a property that requires little or no work.\r\nThe interior has been thoughtfully maintained and finished to a high standard, creating a contemporary yet homely atmosphere throughout. The turn-key condition is a particular highlight, offering prospective purchasers the opportunity to settle in immediately without the disruption or expense often associated with updating a property.\r\nThe three bedrooms and ample storage, including built-in wardrobes provide excellent flexibility for family living, guest accommodation or working from home, while the overall layout is both functional and easy to enjoy. Every room benefits from the care and attention that has gone into the presentation of this attractive home.\r\nThe location further enhances the appeal of the property. Devenish Road is situated within easy reach of a wide range of local shops, schools, parks and everyday amenities, while excellent transport links provide convenient access to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas.\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the quality, presentation and welcoming atmosphere this lovely property has to offer.\r\nViewings by appointment only.\r\nFeatures:\r\nSouth Facing Garden\r\nTurnkey Finish Throughout\r\nRear Lane with Garage Access\r\nExtended Living areas\r\nGarage with pluming & Electricity"
      },
      {
